msgid "✅ Signed up: %1$s at %2$s, %3$s.\n\nShow your ticket at the door - it is the first button below.\n\nTo cancel, tap the task again on the group board or in /board in a private chat, or tap Cancel in your reminder. Or ask someone to take it over with 🔁 Take over a task under /me."
